layer=com_25
textfont=verdana_13pt_regular
text=Breakdown
textlineheight=15
textshadow=yes
colour=0xff7d1f

// 1298:1
[com_1]
type=text
x=7
y=26
width=432
height=62
layer=com_25
textfont=verdana_11pt_regular
text=The above fee will be taken from your money pouch should you proceed into the arena. You can get a certain amount of this fee back (potentially all of it) depending on your actions by visiting one of the banks in the arena.
textlineheight=15
textshadow=yes
colour=0xff7d1f

// 1298:2
[com_2]
type=text
x=7
y=96
width=432
height=44
layer=com_25
textfont=verdana_11pt_regular
text=Target abandonment: When you have a bounty target, if you log out for more than 5 minutes or return to one of the bank areas, part of your bounty fee will go to your opponent:
textlineheight=15
textshadow=yes
colour=0xff7d1f

// 1298:3
[com_3]
type=text
x=7
y=152
width=432
height=60
layer=com_25
textfont=verdana_11pt_regular
text=Death: You are expected to risk a certain value of equipment relative to your combat levels. If your bounty target kills you, you will lose from your fee a value equal to the appropriate amount of risk for your combat levels minus the value of items you are risking. So, the more you risk, the smaller this fee will be. This is:
textlineheight=15
textshadow=yes
colour=0xff7d1f

// 1298:4
[com_4]
type=text
x=7
y=235
width=432
height=30
layer=com_25
textfont=verdana_11pt_regular
text=Your total fee is the amount for 'target abandonment' plus the fee on death: 
textlineheight=15
textshadow=yes
colour=0xff7d1f

